INT. CALL CENTER - COMPLAINTS DEPARTMENT - DAY

Cubicles. Headsets. A banner reads "WE LISTEN!" in sagging letters.

CYPRIAN OYELARAN-BLOOM (30s, headset askew) slams his desk. AGATHA "AGGIE" VANTERPOOL-NKEMELU (50s, supervisor, cardigan, mug that says WORLD'S OKAYEST BOSS) strides over. MORDECAI "MOE" LINDQVIST-SANTOS (20s, intern, tie too wide) trails behind her with a notepad. ROSAMUND FEATHERSTONE-ABIOLA (60s, a customer) is audible only through the headset.

CYPRIAN
(into mic)
Ma'am, I understand.

ROSAMUND (V.O.)
(tinny, furious)
You do NOT understand!

CYPRIAN
Ma'am, the toaster is under warranty.

ROSAMUND (V.O.)
It exploded!

CYPRIAN
Ma'am, "exploded" is not a covered event.

AGGIE
Cyprian. Hold.

CYPRIAN
(muting)
She says it exploded.

AGGIE
Did it?

CYPRIAN
She sent a photo.

He tilts the monitor. A blackened ceiling, a toast-shaped hole.

MOE
Is that a toast-shaped hole?

AGGIE
Moe, take a note.

MOE
What note?

AGGIE
"Do not tell her it is covered."

MOE
Why not?

AGGIE
Because then we'd owe her a ceiling.

Cyprian unmutes.

CYPRIAN
Ma'am, we are going to send you a brand-new toaster.

ROSAMUND (V.O.)
A TOASTER?

CYPRIAN
A better toaster.

ROSAMUND (V.O.)
I want a ceiling!

Aggie snatches the headset off Cyprian. Puts it on. Smiles at the monitor.

AGGIE
(sweetly)
Mrs. Featherstone-Abiola, it's Agatha. Have you tried the hat?

ROSAMUND (V.O.)
...What hat?

AGGIE
The complimentary hat.

A pause. Moe and Cyprian stare at her.

ROSAMUND (V.O.)
(softening)
Is it a nice hat?

AGGIE
It's a very nice hat.

She hangs up. Takes off the headset. Cyprian and Moe watch her like she has levitated.

CYPRIAN
There's no hat.

AGGIE
Moe. Find a hat.
